Read the toolkit alongside the 2006 manual, including validation-report contents, monitored operating limits and reporting examples. Reconstruct the argument connecting a measured signal to the validated result. Distinguish a calculated-dose approach from an intensity-setpoint approach and examine what evidence each needs.

